      "questionType": "计算题",
      "difficulty": 1,
      "cognitiveLevel": "理解",
      "stem": "计算：\\frac{4}{9} + \\frac{2}{9} = ?",
      "answer": "\\frac{6}{9}",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "分母相同，分数单位都是 \\frac{1}{9}，直接把分子相加。",
        "4 + 2 = 6，所以 \\frac{4}{9} + \\frac{2}{9} = \\frac{6}{9}。"
      ],
      "commonErrors": [
        "分子分母同时相加",
        "忘记约分"
      ],
      "scorePoints": 1,
      "teachingNote": "强调同分母分数加法的计算法则，提醒学生注意结果是否需要约分。",
      "sourceId": "A1",
      "estimatedTimeSec": 60,
      "isOriginal": true,
      "licenseNote": "InnoSpark-235B 动态生成·仅供教学使用"
    },
    {
      "id": "q002",
      "knowledgePointIds": [
        "math-g5-fraction-same-denominator-add"
      ],
      "layer": "A",
      "questionType": "应用题",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "cognitiveLevel": "理解",
      "stem": "一个水桶装了 \\frac{3}{10} 的水，又倒入了 \\frac{5}{10} 的水，现在水桶里有几分之几的水？",
      "answer": "\\frac{8}{10}",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "求现在水桶里有多少水，用加法：\\frac{3}{10} + \\frac{5}{10}。",
        "分母相同，分子相加：3 + 5 = 8，得 \\frac{8}{10}。"
      ],
      "commonErrors": [
        "误用减法",
        "混淆单位1"
      ],
      "scorePoints": 1,
      "teachingNote": "引导学生理解题目中的数量关系，明确是求总量，因此用加法。",
      "sourceId": "A2",
      "estimatedTimeSec": 60,
      "isOriginal": true,
      "licenseNote": "InnoSpark-235B 动态生成·仅供教学使用"
    },
    {
      "id": "q003",
      "knowledgePointIds": [
        "math-g5-fraction-same-denominator-add"
      ],
      "layer": "B",
      "questionType": "计算题",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "cognitiveLevel": "应用",
      "stem": "计算：\\frac{4}{9} + \\frac{2}{9} - \\frac{1}{9} = ?",
      "answer": "\\frac{5}{9}",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "按从左到右顺序计算：\\frac{4}{9} + \\frac{2}{9} = \\frac{6}{9}。",
        "\\frac{6}{9} - \\frac{1}{9} = \\frac{5}{9}。",
        "注意：\\frac{6}{9} 可以约分为 \\frac{2}{3}，但本题要求同分母运算，直接相减更简便。"
      ],
      "commonErrors": [
        "计算顺序错误，先算减法再算加法",
        "忘记约分（虽然本题答案已最简，但需注意此习惯）"
      ],
      "scorePoints": 1,
      "teachingNote": "强调同分母分数加减法的运算顺序，以及在混合运算中保持分母不变的原则。",
      "sourceId": "B1",
      "estimatedTimeSec": 60,
      "isOriginal": true,
      "licenseNote": "InnoSpark-235B 动态生成·仅供教学使用"
    },
    {
      "id": "q004",
      "knowledgePointIds": [
        "math-g5-fraction-same-denominator-add"
      ],
      "layer": "B",
      "questionType": "应用题",
      "difficulty": 3,
      "cognitiveLevel": "应用",
      "stem": "一瓶果汁，小明喝了 \\frac{3}{10}，小红喝了 \\frac{4}{10}，还剩这瓶果汁的几分之几？",
      "answer": "\\frac{3}{10}",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "将整瓶果汁看作单位 1，即 \\frac{10}{10}。",
        "先计算两人一共喝了多少：\\frac{3}{10} + \\frac{4}{10} = \\frac{7}{10}。",
        "再计算剩余部分：\\frac{10}{10} - \\frac{7}{10} = \\frac{3}{10}。"
      ],
      "commonErrors": [
        "忘记将单位 1 转化为同分母分数（如直接用 1 - \\frac{7}{10} 但未理解其含义）",
        "计算错误，如分子相加时出错"
      ],
      "scorePoints": 1,
      "teachingNote": "引导学生理解单位 1 在分数应用题中的作用，培养分步解决问题的能力。",
      "sourceId": "B2",
      "estimatedTimeSec": 60,
      "isOriginal": true,
      "licenseNote": "InnoSpark-235B 动态生成·仅供教学使用"
    },
    {
      "id": "q005",
      "knowledgePointIds": [
        "math-g5-fraction-same-denominator-add"
      ],
      "layer": "B",
      "questionType": "判断题",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "cognitiveLevel": "应用",
      "stem": "判断对错：\\frac{5}{12} + \\frac{7}{12} = 1。",
      "answer": "对",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "同分母分数相加，分母不变，分子相加：5 + 7 = 12。",
        "所以 \\frac{5}{12} + \\frac{7}{12} = \\frac{12}{12} = 1。",
        "结论：该等式成立。"
      ],
      "commonErrors": [
